# {{ .Name }} (Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## About

Each `{{ .Name }}` grants one role to every member of the organization, on one scope. Default grants that Terraform does not manage are not changed. An organization can have no default grants.

Omit `scope` to grant the role on the whole organization. To grant it on one resource, set `scope.type` and `scope.id`.

This resource is backed by SELECT's v2 API, at `/v2/default-roles`.

